{"type":"Film","id":"FR2017_064","slug":"fr2017-064-c-est-beau-la-vie-quand-on-y-pense","title":{"native":"C'est beau la vie quand on y pense","english":"Accidental Family"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-04-12","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Gérard Jugnot","slug":"gerard-jugnot","name":"Gérard Jugnot","birthYear":1951,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/2/167/173826/format_page/c-est-beau-la-vie-quand-on-y-pense.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9RgOm1RI8ik"},"synopsis":{"native":"Loïc le Tallec, la soixantaine, ne s’est jamais vraiment occupé de son fils. Quand ce dernier disparaît dans un accident de la route, Loïc est dévasté. Il n’a plus qu’une idée en tête : retrouver celui qui vit désormais avec le cœur greffé de son fils. Il va tomber sur Hugo, un jeune que ce cœur tout neuf rend totalement déraisonnable et incontrôlable. Leur rencontre promet d'être explosive.","english":"Sixty-year-old Loic le Tallec never really took care of his son. When his son is killed in a car accident, Loic is devastated. He becomes obsessed with finding the person who now lives thanks to his son's transplanted heart. This leads him to Hugo, a young man who this new heart has made totally unreasonable and uncontrollable. Their encounter promises to be explosive."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2017_064_01","film":"FR2017_064","person":{"id":"Gérard Jugnot","slug":"gerard-jugnot","name":"Gérard Jugnot","birthYear":1951,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"3: Third Age (60-75)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Middle class","profession":"Retired","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"}],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Bern